flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/ai/recommendations] --> B[Receive Finding ID]

    B --> C[Fetch Finding from Database]

    C --> D{Finding Exists?}

    D -- No --> E[Return 404 Finding Not Found]
    D -- Yes --> F[Prepare AI Prompt Context]

    F --> G[Include Vulnerability Type]
    F --> H[Include Severity]
    F --> I[Include Tool Output]
    F --> J[Include OWASP/CVE/CWE Mapping]

    G --> K[AI Recommendation Engine]
    H --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K --> L[Generate Attack Suggestion]
    K --> M[Generate Risk Explanation]
    K --> N[Generate Remediation Advice]

    L --> O[Save AI Output]
    M --> O
    N --> O

    O --> P[Return AI Recommendation Result]